# Space opens a note in place under its row, however tall, and closes it again. A chevron
# sits only on a row that opens. Scrolling through the note keeps the item's line on top.
wait Export posts from the old CMS
press l
wait [Enter]read
frame chevron-only-where-it-opens

press space
wait ▾ ○ Export posts from the old CMS
wait Export plan
frame note-open

press ctrl+d
wait Conversion script
gone Export plan
wait /(?m)^.*┃> ▾ ○ Export posts from the old CMS/
frame item-stays-on-top
press J J J
wait [J/K]scroll
frame scrolled-by-lines

press space
gone Conversion script
wait ▸ ○ Export posts from the old CMS
wait Pick a theme
frame note-closed

press q
exits
